     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">\r\n<div>Hi D-RUGgies,</div>\r\n<div>You have several opportunities this fall to learn more about using R in your research! The Datalab is offering the following workshops during fall quarter:</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>- <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-reproducible-and-collaborative-research-practices-with-r/\" style=\"font-size:16px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:600;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:proxima-nova,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(2,40,81);box-sizing:border-box\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-reproducible-and-collaborative-research-practices-with-r/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464723167000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EDZK4WHr1foBYS47BnXi1\">Introduction\r\n to Reproducible and Collaborative Research Practices with R</a> - September 20-22 (<a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-reproducible-and-collaborative-research-practices-with-r/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-reproducible-and-collaborative-research-practices-with-r/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464723167000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EDZK4WHr1foBYS47BnXi1\">https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-reproducible-and-collaborative-research-practices-with-r/</a>)</div>\r\n<div>- <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-regression-in-r-part-1-of-2/\" style=\"font-size:16px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:600;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:proxima-nova,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(2,40,81);box-sizing:border-box\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-regression-in-r-part-1-of-2/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464723167000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10VTSDbqecF_tq28m975Tl\">Introduction\r\n to Regression in R</a> - November 9 and November 16 (<a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-regression-in-r-part-1-of-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-regression-in-r-part-1-of-2/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464723167000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10VTSDbqecF_tq28m975Tl\">https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-regression-in-r-part-1-of-2/</a>)</div>\r\n<div>- <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/installfest-2023/\" style=\"font-size:16px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:600;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:proxima-nova,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(2,40,81);box-sizing:border-box\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/installfest-2023/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464723167000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16dxEqvbbJu26CPOA-UtGS\">InstallFest\r\n 2023</a> - October 5 (<a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/installfest-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/installfest-2023/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464723167000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16dxEqvbbJu26CPOA-UtGS\">https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/installfest-2023/</a>)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Click the links to learn more, or look over the complete list of workshops here: <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/workshops/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/workshops/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464723167000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0rZrJOHxgEwNriLafhsbC_\">https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/workshops/</a></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>-Wes</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
